#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/news.html:2092
msgid ""
"The Linux From Scratch community announces the release of LFS Version "
"7.7-rc1.  It is a preliminary release of LFS-7.7. Major changes include "
"toolchain updates to binutils-2.25, glibc-2.21, and gcc-4.9.2.  In total, 30 "
"packages were updated since the last release. Changes to the text have also "
"been made throughout the book.  The Linux kernel has also been updated to "
"version 3.19."
msgstr ""
